{
  "id": "E041",
  "title": "Who is Going to Cook?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2016-08-13",
  "synopsis": "How do you decide which one in a relationship will cook dinner?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/199/93352597a65980bd19c9568b8883631e9ace6fd9.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "谁来做晚饭？\n\n下午六点，高先生下班回家了。\n高先生：老婆，我回来了。晚饭做好了吗？\n高太太：还没有。为什么总是我做晚饭？虽然我下班比你早一个小时，可是我工作也很累。\n高先生：对不起，我以为你喜欢做饭……\n高太太：对，可是每天都做太累了。还有，我更喜欢跟你一起做饭。\n高先生：那以后你下班回家先休息。等我回家的时候，我们一起做晚饭吧！\n高太太：太好了！那今天……\n高先生：今天我请你去饭店吃。\n高太太：好……谢谢老公。",
    "traditional": "誰來做晚飯？\n\n下午六點，高先生下班回家了。\n高先生：老婆，我回來了。晚飯做好了嗎？\n高太太：還沒有。為什麼總是我做晚飯？雖然我下班比你早一個小時，可是我工作也很累。\n高先生：對不起，我以為你喜歡做飯……\n高太太：對，可是每天都做太累了。還有，我更喜歡跟你一起做飯。\n高先生：那以後你下班回家先休息。等我回家的時候，我們一起做晚飯吧！\n高太太：太好了！那今天……\n高先生：今天我請你去飯店吃。\n高太太：好……謝謝老公。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Who is going to cook?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "下午六点，高先生下班回家了。",
      "traditional": "下午六點，高先生下班回家了。",
      "pinyin": "xià wǔ liù diǎn gāo xiān sheng xià bān huí jiā le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mr. Gao went back home after work at 6:00pm."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "高先生：老婆，我回来了。晚饭做好了吗？",
      "traditional": "高先生：老婆，我回來了。晚飯做好了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "gāo xiān sheng lǎo po wǒ huí lai le wǎn fàn zuò hǎo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mr. Gao: Dear, I’m back. Is dinner ready?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "高太太：还没有。为什么总是我做晚饭？",
      "traditional": "高太太：還沒有。為什麼總是我做晚飯？",
      "pinyin": "gāo tài tai hái méi yǒu wèi shén me zǒng shì wǒ zuò wǎn fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "虽然我下班比你早一个小时，可是我工作也很累。",
      "traditional": "雖然我下班比你早一個小時，可是我工作也很累。",
      "pinyin": "suī rán wǒ xià bān bǐ nǐ zǎo yí ge xiǎo shí kě shì wǒ gōng zuò yě hěn lèi",
      "english": "Mrs. Gao: Not yet. Why is it always me cooking dinner?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I finish work 1 hour earlier than you, but I am also tired afterwards."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "高先生：对不起，我以为你喜欢做饭……",
      "traditional": "高先生：對不起，我以為你喜歡做飯……",
      "pinyin": "gāo xiān sheng duì bu qǐ wǒ yǐ wéi nǐ xǐ huan zuò fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mr. Gao: Sorry. I thought you like cooking..."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "高太太：对，可是每天都做太累了。还有，我更喜欢跟你一起做饭。",
      "traditional": "高太太：對，可是每天都做太累了。還有，我更喜歡跟你一起做飯。",
      "pinyin": "gāo tài tai duì kě shì měi tiān dōu zuò tài lèi le hái yǒu wǒ gèng xǐ huan gēn nǐ yì qǐ zuò fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mrs. Gao: I do, but cooking everyday makes me really tired. Also, I like cooking together with you better."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "高先生：那以后你下班回家先休息。",
      "traditional": "高先生：那以後你下班回家先休息。",
      "pinyin": "gāo xiān sheng nà yǐ hòu nǐ xià bān huí jiā xiān xiū xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "等我回家的时候，我们一起做晚饭吧！",
      "traditional": "等我回家的時候，我們一起做晚飯吧！",
      "pinyin": "děng wǒ huí jiā de shí hou wǒ men yì qǐ zuò wǎn fàn ba",
      "english": "Mr. Gao: Then from now on, you first relax when you get back home after work."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When I come home we can start making dinner together!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "高太太：太好了！那今天……",
      "traditional": "高太太：太好了！那今天……",
      "pinyin": "gāo tài tai tài hǎo le nà jīn tiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mrs. Gao: Great! Today we can…"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "高先生：今天我请你去饭店吃。",
      "traditional": "高先生：今天我請你去飯店吃。",
      "pinyin": "gāo xiān sheng jīn tiān wǒ qǐng nǐ qù fàn diàn chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mr. Gao: I’ll treat you to dinner in a restaurant today."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "高太太：好……谢谢老公。",
      "traditional": "高太太：好……謝謝老公。",
      "pinyin": "gāo tài tai hǎo xiè xie lǎo gōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mrs. Gao: Ok… Thank you, dear."
    }
  ],
